est_calculate_composite_score	Verifies the weighted composite score is calculated correctly.
test_calculate_composite_score_empty_dataframe	Verifies an empty DataFrame is returned unchanged as a copy.
test_calculate_composite_score_missing_column	Verifies missing required metric columns raise a ValueError.
test_calculate_composite_score_invalid_weights	Verifies invalid weights that do not sum to 1.0 raise a ValueError.
test_rank_models	Verifies models are ranked in descending order of composite score.
test_select_champion	Verifies the highest-ranked model is selected as Champion.
test_select_champion_empty	Verifies no Champion is returned when the ranked DataFrame is empty.
test_select_challenger	Verifies the second-ranked model is selected as Challenger.
test_select_challenger_when_only_one_model	Verifies no Challenger is returned when only one model exists.
test_prepare_alias_mapping	Verifies Champion and Challenger aliases are created correctly.
test_prepare_alias_mapping_without_challenger	Verifies only the Champion alias is created when no Challenger exists.
test_clears_promotion_floor	Verifies a candidate meeting the minimum score passes the promotion floor.
test_does_not_clear_promotion_floor	Verifies a candidate below the minimum score fails the promotion floor.
test_clears_promotion_floor_with_none	Verifies a None candidate fails the promotion floor check.
test_beats_incumbent_when_no_incumbent	Verifies a candidate passes when there is no incumbent Champion.
test_beats_incumbent	Verifies a candidate with a higher score can beat the incumbent Champion.
test_does_not_beat_incumbent	Verifies a candidate with a lower score cannot replace the incumbent Champion.
test_beats_incumbent_with_none_candidate	Verifies a None candidate cannot beat an incumbent.
test_promote_models_success	Verifies successful promotion assigns Champion and Challenger correctly.
test_promote_models_empty_dataframe	Verifies promotion raises an error when no evaluation results are available.
test_promote_models_blocked_below_floor	Verifies promotion is blocked when the top model is below the minimum score floor.
test_promote_models_blocked_by_incumbent	Verifies promotion is blocked when the candidate cannot beat the incumbent Champion.
test_promote_models_challenger_below_floor	Verifies a below-floor Challenger is retained with its score but does not receive a Challenger alias.
test_promote_models_single_model	Verifies a single qualifying model becomes Champion with no Challenger.
